window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I'm at the hospital...it's over.... </p> <p>When Tom awakens, he is greeted by law enforcement, medical treatment, and a sense of normalcy - all the things that have been missing for the last day. What Tom doesn't know is that some nightmares are meant to be relived, and The Great Storm is far from finished. </p> <p>Haven't started Outage? Get the boxed set, books 1-3, now on audio! </p>"; 
